    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d912">

                <pb facs="1004" n="992" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg992"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">859A.01/156a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Iceland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-06-10T22:00:00-04:00">June 10, 1944—10
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>221. The House of Representatives unanimously passed this morning a concurrent
                    Resolution expressing the congratulations of the Congress <pb facs="1005"
                        n="993" xml:id="pg993"/> to the Althing on the establishment of the Republic
                    of Iceland. The full text of the Resolution will be telegraphed<anchor n="17"
                        xml:id="d912-f1"/> to you after it has been voted by the Senate.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
